Description: English translation hints for Fcitx5 Rime candidates
 A lightweight Fcitx5 addon that shows concise English translations for the
 current Rime candidate page through the input panel auxiliary text. Network
 requests run asynchronously and the original Chinese candidates are left
 unchanged.
